    "body": "I'm sorry, this isn't an appropriate form to ask for help coding your website. I'd suggest https://stackoverflow.com. Describe what affect you are trying to achieve in a bit more detail when asking a question there. It sounds very doable with normal HTML and JavaScript (the mousemove event being key).\n\nFor example, the demo at http://www.html5rocks.com/en/tutorials/dnd/basics/ titled \"Completing a Drag\" shows how to change the drop target's styling to have a dashed border. You could change it to have whatever text you want.\n",
