    "body": "Hi Domenic, \n\nThanks for the interesting references with valuable hints. But I still think there is a misunderstanding.\n\nBasically, the whole visible area is my drop target.\nI already do minor styling on the drop target.\nBut what I am interested in is to change the cursor appearance during the drag before the drop.\nI would like to add some text (better than replacing the cursor image [with some bitmap text] and even that somehow didn't work as per bugzilla).\nThat doesn't appear to be possible or is it?\n",
