    "updated_at": "2015-09-13T18:41:39Z",
    "body": "It's definitely possible. Just create a div that follows the mouse cursor. Here are a lot of examples: https://www.google.com/search?q=div+that+follows+mouse+cursor&ie=utf-8&oe=utf-8\n\nGoing to close this since it is really a web development question and not an issue with the HTML spec. I'd ask that in the future you ask such questions on StackOverflow or similar.\n",
